Implement Employee Projects, Leave, and Activity Dashboards

1. Introduction

   As part of the Employee Analytics module, dedicated dashboards for Projects, Leave, and Activity were implemented to provide a comprehensive view of an employee's work and engagement. These sections extend the Employee Detail Analytics Workspace by organizing employee-specific information into separate analytical views, enabling managers and administrators to monitor project involvement, leave history, and recent activities from a single workspace.

   This implementation enhances visibility into employee performance while maintaining a clean and intuitive user interface.

2. Objective

   The objective of this implementation was to expand the Employee Detail Analytics Workspace by introducing dedicated dashboards for Projects, Leave, and Activity, allowing users to efficiently analyze employee participation, leave records, and work history.

3. Employee Projects Dashboard

   A dedicated Projects section was implemented to display all projects assigned to an employee.

   Displayed Information
   Project Name
   Project Progress
   Task Completion Percentage
   Total Tasks
   Completed Tasks
   Pending Tasks
   Project Status
   Implemented Features
   Project summary cards
   Progress indicators
   Completion percentage display
   Responsive project layout
   Project status visualization
   Outcome

   Provides managers with clear visibility into employee involvement across different projects and helps track overall project progress.

4. Employee Leave Dashboard

   A dedicated Leave section was developed to organize employee leave information in a structured format.

   Displayed Information
   Leave Type
   Leave Duration
   Start Date
   End Date
   Approval Status
   Implemented Features
   Leave history table
   Leave status indicators
   Responsive table layout
   Organized leave records
   Outcome

   Allows users to review employee leave records and understand leave history without navigating to separate modules.

5. Employee Activity Dashboard

   The Activity dashboard was introduced to display recent employee work activities in chronological order.

   Activity Categories
